What this covers
----------------

This license covers the original metadata and annotations we produced for
BulkPR-Bench. Concretely, that is everything under `data/` EXCEPT the diff
files, plus the prose documentation under `docs/`:

  * the relation rules, must-reject sets and oracle solutions with their
    proofs, in each `data/pools/<repo>/pool.json`
  * the public projection schema itself (`public-pool/v1`)
  * the neutral PR identifiers and the default review order
  * the upstream provenance table (`data/repos.json`)
  * the self-check reference table (`data/reference/reproducibility.json`)
  * the documentation under `docs/`

